---LINES
var     = ipv   -       -       -       -         "0.98beta"
alt1    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "YES"
alt2    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipm   -       -       -       -         " End of work "
---#sp      = h     "space "
sp      = iv    -       -       -       -     "[space]"


---SCREEN                                     
=LINLIB/VISI - screen library/toolkit

."visual sample:".................                    
   .mse............  - menu item       
   .var....... - editable string       
   .alt2.             - selector        ."all page control keys"................

."control keys:"..................      - Get help                .:HE...
 - select menu item:       .:SP...      - Exit, end of the page   .:EX...
 - start line editing:                  - Refresh screen          .:RE...
     * keep content        .:SP...      
     * clear before edit   .:DE...      - Page navigation:   
 - selector cycle/toggle:                 * to next line:       .:TA... 
              * forward    .:SP...        * arrow keys, 
              * backward   .:DE...        .:KH... .:KE... .:PU... .:PD...
                                              
=Line editor control
- Erase:                         - Jump:                      ."2-keys".........
  * left from cursor  .:DE...      * to 1st symbol    .:KH...  .:PR..., .:AL...
  * below cursor      .:KD...      * to end of text   .:KE...  .:PR..., .:AR...
  * up to end .:PR..., .:SP...    
- Commit changes:      .:NL...   - Ins/Ovr mode       .:KI...  .:PR..., .:PR...

---END

   ."line types".................
 
   .var....... - editable string
   .alt2.         - selector
   .mse............ - menu item
 
  - Get help                .:HE...
  - Exit, end of the page   .:EX...
  - Refresh screen          .:RE...
 
 - Move to next line.... .:TA... 
 - Navigation:
 .:AU... .:AD... .:AL... .:AR... 
